  "problem_statement": "The vfs_umount() function must be callable with a second boolean force parameter: int vfs_umount(vfs_mount_t *mountp, bool force). When force is false, unmounting a mounted filesystem that still has open files must fail with -EBUSY, while unmounting a mounted filesystem with no open files must succeed. When force is true, the filesystem must be unmounted even if open files are present and the call must succeed.",
